    "text 54.00 72.98 18 \"The Images\"",
    "text 54.00 90.80 11 \"My father had a small estate in Nottinghamshire: I was the third of five sons.  He\"",
    "text 54.00 106.20 11 \"sent me to Emanuel College in Cambridge at fourteen years old, where I resided\"",
    "text 54.00 121.60 11 \"three years, and applied myself close to my studies; but the charge of maintaining\"",
    "text 54.00 137.00 11 \"me, although I had a very scanty allowance, being too great for a narrow fortune,\"",
    "text 54.00 152.40 11 \"I was bound apprentice to Mr. James Bates, an eminent surgeon in London,\"",
    "text 54.00 167.80 11 \"with whom I continued four years.\"",
